	Annotations: bim:Definition "Declares the Revit ID or IFC GlobalId or unique object identifier. It is an Intensive Care Unit (ICU). It can be Neonatal, Pediatric, Cardiology, Neurological, etc. Multiprofessional and Multiparametric Monitoring. Provided for in Anvisa's RDCs"@en
	Annotations: bim:CatRevit "[ OST_Areas : OST_Rooms : OST_MEPSpaces : OST_MEPZone : OST_MedicalEquipment :  OST_NurseCallDevices ]"
