	Annotations: bim:Definition "Declares that it is a biosafety laboratory security level 3 or containment. Intended for work with class 3 biological risk agents, microorganisms that pose a high risk to the researcher and a low risk to the community.  Consult ABNT NBR ISO 35001 – Biorisk Management for Laboratories and Related Organizations."@en
	Annotations: bim:CatRevit "[ OST_Rooms : OST_MEPSpaces : OST_MEPZone ]"
	Annotations: bim:ClasseIfc "[ IfcSpace : IfcOccupant ]"
